WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A kitten sits on a carpet with its back to the camera, grooming.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The kitten turns side-on and licks its paw.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The kitten turns to face the camera.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.800
It gets up and walks past close to the camera.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.200
It walks out of view to the left.
